{"id":"2b86695d5c9cd5ac","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-sentence.md","title":"闭公式","display":"df-sentence — 闭公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-sentence","aliases":["56-df-sentence"],"display":"df-sentence — 闭公式","depends_on":["[[56-df-free-variable]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sentence — 闭公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9950d502a3a677fa\" href=\"?note=9950d502a3a677fa\" title=\"56-df-free-variable\">56-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的公式集合及自由变量函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9950d502a3a677fa\" href=\"?note=9950d502a3a677fa\" title=\"56-df-free-variable\">56-df-free-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Sentence}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Sentence}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点区分闭公式与可以含自由变量的等式；重写规则中的变量通常按所有赋值解释，不能因为等式未加量词就把它误称为句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"9950d502a3a677fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"9950d502a3a677fa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定语言 $L$ 的公式集合及自由变量函数，见 [[56-df-free-variable]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Sentence}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L.","display":true}],"bytes":991,"backlinks":[{"id":"59f2769e44131c6a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定一阶语言 $L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$；$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，句子集合见 [[56-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"3b00d8ba9ccb238d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[56-df-sentence]]；$\\Phi\